WEBVTT

00:06.880 --> 00:08.080
<b>Still sleepy...</b>

00:08.750 --> 00:13.000
<b>Don'tcha think you oughta march over
to your neighbor's place and give 'em a good talking to?</b>

00:13.040 --> 00:16.250
<b>Nobody can sleep with all their shouting
so early in the morning.</b>

00:16.880 --> 00:17.750
<b>I suppose.</b>

00:19.210 --> 00:22.580
<b>Stupid bitch! You got a problem with us or what?!</b>

00:22.580 --> 00:23.500
<b>Not at all.</b>

00:23.830 --> 00:26.210
<b>H-hey, you two need to cut it out right now!</b>

00:26.210 --> 00:27.080
<b>T-take it easy.</b>

00:27.080 --> 00:27.710
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:29.000 --> 00:31.000
<b>It's awfully rowdy in here today.</b>

00:31.330 --> 00:33.040
<b>Oh, Jinya-kun!</b>

00:33.040 --> 00:35.130
<b>The hell do you want?!</b>

00:35.830 --> 00:38.540
<b>Just drunken fools? Or something worse?</b>

00:38.790 --> 00:42.670
<b>If ya ask me, the latter seems far more likely.</b>

00:42.790 --> 00:43.670
<b>I concur.</b>

00:44.040 --> 00:47.630
<b>What kinda stupid bullshit are you spewing, boy?!</b>

00:47.630 --> 00:51.170
<b>Hah. Actually, I'd bet this guy's
more of an old fart than you.</b>

00:51.540 --> 00:52.960
<b>You goddamn jokers...</b>

00:56.710 --> 00:59.170
<b>Aw, jeez. Now you've done it.</b>

01:02.460 --> 01:03.830
<b>Would you like to be next?</b>

01:05.580 --> 01:06.500
<b>You bastar-!</b>

01:12.630 --> 01:14.460
<b>Talk about ruthless.</b>

01:14.630 --> 01:16.330
<b>I held myself back.</b>

01:16.460 --> 01:18.040
<b>Yeah, well, even so...</b>

01:27.580 --> 01:30.040
<b>Whoa! They're getting back up.</b>

01:31.040 --> 01:34.580
<b>That's it. Your ass is grass!</b>

01:35.830 --> 01:37.330
<b>Guess I've got no choice.</b>

01:46.960 --> 01:47.540
<b>Hey!</b>

01:58.920 --> 02:01.580
<b>Get back here, shithead!</b>

02:04.670 --> 02:06.670
<b>What just happened?</b>

02:07.670 --> 02:08.920
<b>What did you do?</b>

02:09.580 --> 02:10.500
<b>Hm?</b>

02:12.710 --> 02:16.380
<b>These decorative shells are tsukumogami
that create mirages.</b>

02:16.750 --> 02:21.040
<b>And I can control it so that only people
who I choose see them. Pretty useful, huh?</b>

02:21.170 --> 02:22.960
<b>What exactly did you show them?</b>

02:23.460 --> 02:25.830
<b>Don'tcha know that ignorance is bliss?</b>

02:26.540 --> 02:30.170
<b>Um, thanks, Jinya-kun. I'm glad you showed up.</b>

02:30.500 --> 02:31.500
<b>Sure.</b>

02:31.630 --> 02:32.750
<b>Same to you, Akitsu-san.</b>

02:32.960 --> 02:35.920
<b>Shucks, I didn't do much.</b>

02:36.170 --> 02:37.830
<b>Yeah, he literally just watched.</b>

02:37.830 --> 02:38.500
<b>Hm?</b>

02:39.960 --> 02:42.250
<b>I see you're still as snarky as ever, lil' missy.</b>

02:42.790 --> 02:45.380
<b>Ofuu-chan, can I get some tempura soba?</b>

02:45.580 --> 02:46.330
<b>Okay.</b>

02:46.710 --> 02:48.830
<b>I'm assuming you want kake-soba, Jinya-kun?</b>

02:49.170 --> 02:49.920
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:23.250 --> 04:24.000
<b>And so...</b>

04:24.250 --> 04:30.290
<b>Zenji's been working like a madman ever since my dad
threatened to fire him from the head clerk position.</b>

04:30.420 --> 04:32.920
<b>Have you noticed anything strange about his behavior?</b>

04:33.290 --> 04:34.040
<b>Not really.</b>

04:34.710 --> 04:38.420
<b>Like I figured, it seems knocking back too many drinks
is what drove him to act out yesterday.</b>

04:40.670 --> 04:43.750
<b>Sorry to worry you, but everything is okay now.</b>

04:44.210 --> 04:45.210
<b>I see.</b>

04:45.670 --> 04:47.830
<b>Well, I should get going.</b>

04:48.130 --> 04:50.830
<b>Maybe I can put my dad in a better mood
if I pick him up a bottle of sake on the way ho-</b>

04:50.830 --> 04:51.830
<b>You'd better not.</b>

04:53.670 --> 04:54.580
<b>And why's that?</b>

04:54.750 --> 04:58.040
<b>He's been drinking Yuki-no-Nagori every night, hasn't he?</b>

04:58.540 --> 05:00.080
<b>There's something strange about it.</b>

05:00.580 --> 05:03.790
<b>Please tell Jyuuzou-dono that he should drink
a different sake instead.</b>

05:04.790 --> 05:06.540
<b>A-all right.</b>

05:07.170 --> 05:08.290
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

05:09.170 --> 05:11.790
<b>Be careful on your way home. It's dicey out there.</b>

05:12.330 --> 05:16.540
<b>Funny. I didn't know you could give dad speeches, too.</b>

05:16.880 --> 05:19.880
<b>But I'll be okay. Thank you.</b>

05:22.580 --> 05:25.710
<b>Looks like the sparrow is still just a sparrow, huh?</b>

05:26.580 --> 05:29.500
<b>Yes. A long way from becoming a clam.</b>

05:38.080 --> 05:41.460
<b>Why hello, ronin. Did you bring a friend along today?</b>

05:41.460 --> 05:43.500
<b>Don't mind him. He's not important.</b>

05:43.500 --> 05:46.580
<b>Ouch. Do you always hafta be so mean to me?</b>

05:47.250 --> 05:49.290
<b>Well, not that I really care.</b>

05:49.880 --> 05:52.420
<b>I did some digging into that liquor you asked me about.</b>

05:52.790 --> 05:54.000
<b>Have you learned anything?</b>

05:55.040 --> 05:57.630
<b>I couldn't get any clear answers
about where Yuki-no-Nagori is made,</b>

05:57.920 --> 06:01.420
<b>or even how it got brought into Edo.</b>

06:02.040 --> 06:04.920
<b>But I learned that a sake shop
in Kuramae was responsible for ordering</b>

06:04.920 --> 06:07.290
<b>a huge stock and wholesaling it throughout town.</b>

06:07.790 --> 06:09.830
<b>Do you remember "Mizukiya"?</b>

06:10.880 --> 06:15.540
<b>The owner there hired you a while back
to slay a demon that was hiding in his warehouse.</b>

06:17.040 --> 06:20.460
<b>Some of my customers told me they tried to ask
where the sake was brewed,</b>

06:20.710 --> 06:25.580
<b>but the owner dodged their questions with nonsense
like, "It's divine liquor that flows from a sacred spring."</b>

06:26.130 --> 06:31.210
<b>Hah! Is he just ripping off the myth of the woodcutter who
found a fountain of youth that tastes like sake or what?</b>

06:31.210 --> 06:32.920
<b>Talk about pathetic.</b>

06:33.130 --> 06:34.420
<b>You said it.</b>

06:35.250 --> 06:40.290
<b>The owner has gone out today to procure more stock,
but word is that he'll be back tomorrow night.</b>

06:40.290 --> 06:42.210
<b>Why don't you pay him a visit?</b>

06:42.460 --> 06:44.380
<b>I will. Thank you.</b>

06:47.000 --> 06:48.210
<b>One more thing.</b>

06:48.790 --> 06:53.580
<b>There are rumors of a beautiful woman with golden hair
going in and out of Mizukiya on occasion.</b>

06:54.420 --> 06:59.040
<b>This is just a hunch, but it's possible
that Yuki-no-Nagori may be a sake made overseas.</b>

06:59.040 --> 06:59.790
<b>No!</b>

07:00.500 --> 07:02.960
<b>What's your problem? Don't jump at me like that.</b>

07:05.130 --> 07:05.880
<b>Sorry.</b>

07:06.710 --> 07:10.670
<b>Does this golden-haired beauty
give you a clue or something?</b>

07:21.040 --> 07:23.750
<b>Please, Dad. I'm begging you to stop.</b>

07:23.750 --> 07:25.500
<b>And I keep telling you to shut the hell up!</b>

07:25.500 --> 07:29.670
<b>Ugh, not again! What a noisy pair.</b>

07:29.920 --> 07:30.920
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:33.250 --> 07:34.790
<b>D-Dad, no!</b>

07:35.750 --> 07:36.210
<b>Jinya!</b>

07:46.130 --> 07:48.040
<b>He's turned into a demon!</b>

08:33.330 --> 08:35.170
<b>Wow! Nicely done.</b>

08:41.170 --> 08:44.420
<b>Guess we've got more questions
for that sake-selling geezer now.</b>

08:51.630 --> 08:52.790
<b>Father?</b>

08:53.000 --> 08:53.880
<b>Yes?</b>

08:54.330 --> 08:55.830
<b>Pardon me.</b>

09:04.210 --> 09:06.790
<b>Um, I wanted to talk about Zenji...</b>

09:07.290 --> 09:08.080
<b>What about him?</b>

09:09.080 --> 09:10.080
<b>Are you upset?</b>

09:11.580 --> 09:15.880
<b>More like disappointed.
After all I've done to look out for him.</b>

09:18.500 --> 09:21.040
<b>Still, he is quite young...</b>

09:21.960 --> 09:28.580
<b>As long as he buckles down to work hard and live
proper, there's nothing that he can't bounce back from.</b>

09:29.040 --> 09:31.500
<b>So, you'll forgive Zenji? For what he did?</b>

09:32.380 --> 09:34.040
<b>It depends on him.</b>

09:34.210 --> 09:39.710
<b>Mistakes are complicated.
We can't easily measure the full impact they have.</b>

09:40.500 --> 09:46.290
<b>Sometimes it's not until much later when you realize
the scale. And it can leave you frozen in fear.</b>

09:47.040 --> 09:50.500
<b>It sounds like... you might be
speaking from personal experience.</b>

09:50.750 --> 09:51.500
<b>Maybe.</b>

09:52.330 --> 09:56.630
<b>In any case, regardless of how deeply
youngsters may regret their choices later on,</b>

09:56.880 --> 10:02.460
<b>I believe it's important for them to live their life
as they please. Whole-heartedly.</b>

10:03.540 --> 10:05.670
<b>And when they inevitably take a tumble,</b>

10:05.670 --> 10:10.460
<b>it's the adults in their lives who have a duty
to provide them a place to return to.</b>

10:11.460 --> 10:15.040
<b>Natsu. You should do the same and live freely.</b>

10:15.420 --> 10:18.170
<b>Freely? Even me?</b>

10:20.670 --> 10:24.330
<b>Bear in mind there's nothing
that you can't bounce back from.</b>

10:25.380 --> 10:26.040
<b>Right.</b>

10:27.500 --> 10:31.460
<b>Father, you really should cut down on the sake.</b>

10:31.580 --> 10:36.250
<b>I'm in a drinking mood right now.
Thanks to good company.</b>

10:37.670 --> 10:41.170
<b>Oh, right. I brought you a gift. They're teacakes.</b>

10:41.290 --> 10:44.380
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

10:41.580 --> 10:43.580
<b>Wonderful. I'll have some later.</b>

10:44.580 --> 10:46.880
<b>Wh-who are you?!</b>

10:47.250 --> 10:51.540
<b>Might I interest you in a sake so superb
that it could ruin a man?</b>

10:52.040 --> 10:54.750
<b>Ruin? What do you mean?</b>

10:55.330 --> 11:00.670
<b>Everyone, regardless of who they are,
has a soul clouded with filth.</b>

11:01.750 --> 11:06.500
<b>Try as they might, there is no way to hide or avoid it.</b>

11:06.880 --> 11:08.580
<b>I don't understand...</b>

11:09.130 --> 11:11.830
<b>All you must do is dredge it to the surface.</b>

11:12.040 --> 11:15.880
<b>Jealousy, carnality, pride.</b>

11:16.790 --> 11:20.250
<b>Shatter the calm facades that people wear
by stirring up every dark feeling hidden</b>

11:20.250 --> 11:22.210
<b>in the far recesses of their hearts.</b>

11:22.790 --> 11:24.210
<b>And taint them!</b>

11:24.960 --> 11:26.670
<b>Until finally...</b>

11:27.420 --> 11:33.380
<b>...hatred piles up like snow
and colors their true heart white.</b>

11:34.250 --> 11:38.080
<b>Thus I dub it Yuki-no-Nagori or "snowy remains."</b>

11:38.750 --> 11:41.130
<b>When all of the human's hearts are steeped in rage,</b>

11:41.540 --> 11:43.540
<b>perhaps he will notice.</b>

11:45.250 --> 11:48.130
<b>I'm right here. Waiting for you.</b>

12:14.040 --> 12:18.540
<b>This is more than enough for me
to become the richest merchant in all of Edo!</b>

12:22.130 --> 12:24.580
<b>Looks like business is booming for you, merchant.</b>

12:25.920 --> 12:27.210
<b>Who goes there?</b>

12:27.420 --> 12:31.000
<b>We met once about two years ago. Do you remember?</b>

12:31.210 --> 12:33.290
<b>Why, of course!</b>

12:33.830 --> 12:37.130
<b>You're the gentleman who killed the demon
plaguing our storehouse.</b>

12:37.290 --> 12:42.750
<b>Although I greatly appreciated your help,
I cannot condone you trespassing on my property...</b>

12:43.040 --> 12:46.750
<b>I have business with you.
I'll gladly leave once its finished.</b>

12:47.130 --> 12:49.460
<b>Wh-what kind of business?</b>

12:49.750 --> 12:51.500
<b>I'm looking for a certain sake.</b>

12:52.580 --> 12:55.000
<b>Yuki-no-Nagori. You have some, no?</b>

12:56.040 --> 12:57.210
<b>Well, I...</b>

12:57.210 --> 12:59.580
<b>Wow! Now that's an impressive haul.</b>

12:59.790 --> 13:00.790
<b>Who are you?!</b>

13:00.790 --> 13:02.580
<b>This is all Yuki-no-Nagori.</b>

13:02.580 --> 13:03.290
<b>Hey!</b>

13:03.380 --> 13:05.130
<b>It certainly is impressive.</b>

13:06.750 --> 13:11.420
<b>This sake is hugely popular and sold out in every store.
Finding it has been a hassle.</b>

13:13.170 --> 13:17.420
<b>Ah, but of course! Since I just went
and procured this new stock today.</b>

13:17.420 --> 13:19.290
<b>Oh? Where exactly?</b>

13:19.670 --> 13:24.170
<b>I'm afraid I can't tell you that.
This is how I make my living, after all.</b>

13:25.000 --> 13:26.580
<b>What a shame.</b>

13:27.000 --> 13:30.880
<b>In that case, let me try a slightly more coercive method...</b>

13:37.880 --> 13:40.290
<b>Natsu. Would you care for a drink?</b>

13:40.290 --> 13:41.920
<b>Huh? But I...</b>

13:46.420 --> 13:48.040
<b>Okay, just one sip.</b>

13:53.460 --> 13:55.170
<b>Would you pour me a cup?</b>

13:55.540 --> 13:56.540
<b>Sure.</b>

14:08.880 --> 14:12.420
<b>Tastes superb. Don't you think?</b>

14:18.460 --> 14:21.290
<b>Unusual incidents have been on the rise lately.</b>

14:21.830 --> 14:24.420
<b>Mostly drunkards going on violent rampages.</b>

14:24.670 --> 14:27.960
<b>Notably, all people who were drinking Yuki-no-Nagori.</b>

14:28.500 --> 14:29.920
<b>Ah, um, uh...</b>

14:30.130 --> 14:34.170
<b>That sake is clearly tainted. Where did you get it from?</b>

14:34.670 --> 14:36.380
<b>F-from Mount Oyama!</b>

14:36.790 --> 14:41.880
<b>There's a spring halfway up Mount Oyama
in Sagami province, a-and that's where it flows from!</b>

14:42.170 --> 14:44.420
<b>All I've done is bottle it!</b>

14:45.250 --> 14:47.630
<b>Interesting. So, you prefer death, then?</b>

14:48.250 --> 14:51.830
<b>I applaud your fortitude. I'm sure it'll prove useful in Hell.</b>

14:53.130 --> 14:58.080
<b>I'm not lying! There really is a spring
of pure sake! Please believe me!</b>

14:58.500 --> 15:00.830
<b>Fine, then what's the secret behind it?</b>

15:01.040 --> 15:06.130
<b>D-don't ask me! All I know
is that woman said it could ruin people!</b>

15:06.130 --> 15:07.130
<b>Woman?</b>

15:07.630 --> 15:11.880
<b>A blonde one! She said the more people drank,
the more they'd become slaves to hatred!</b>

15:12.210 --> 15:14.290
<b>But that's everything she told me!</b>

15:14.920 --> 15:17.460
<b>And you thought that was okay to sell?!</b>

15:17.670 --> 15:23.210
<b>So what if people act a little weird after
they drink too much? That's just natural with booze!</b>

15:23.380 --> 15:25.710
<b>There's nothing wrong with a merchant selling his goods!</b>

15:26.080 --> 15:28.670
<b>So, you did it for the money, huh?</b>

15:29.000 --> 15:32.420
<b>Here I figured ya had some good reason,
but you're just scum.</b>

15:33.380 --> 15:37.210
<b>Jinya. This fool is useless, he only sells the stuff.</b>

15:37.420 --> 15:39.040
<b>But we have a lead on the mastermind.</b>

15:39.830 --> 15:43.380
<b>And now we know for sure that all the violence
going down was caused by Yuki-no-Nagori.</b>

15:43.630 --> 15:46.790
<b>Let's destroy this batch and head for Oyama.</b>

15:47.130 --> 15:50.460
<b>D-destroy?! You can't be serious!</b>

15:50.710 --> 15:54.330
<b>What else do you expect?
That stuff is way too dangerous for us to leave behind!</b>

15:55.080 --> 15:56.580
<b>Screw that!</b>

15:58.710 --> 16:01.040
<b>I still want information from you.</b>

16:01.040 --> 16:02.250
<b>Whoa there!</b>

16:03.080 --> 16:06.000
<b>Tell me everything you know about that woman.</b>

16:07.920 --> 16:10.710
<b>L-let me...</b>

16:11.380 --> 16:13.250
<b>Start talking, now!</b>

16:16.420 --> 16:17.460
<b>Cut it out already!</b>

16:22.580 --> 16:25.170
<b>Yeowch! What are you, a brick wall?</b>

16:25.460 --> 16:28.710
<b>You better stop or else that geezer
is seriously gonna croak!</b>

16:29.880 --> 16:33.210
<b>This blonde lady... is she some kinda problem?</b>

16:33.960 --> 16:34.790
<b>No.</b>

16:35.750 --> 16:37.920
<b>I won't press you to give me any details.</b>

16:38.040 --> 16:42.920
<b>But if you start killin' people over this,
then I'm gonna have to put you down myself.</b>

16:43.500 --> 16:46.880
<b>You're right. Thanks for stopping me.</b>

16:47.210 --> 16:51.710
<b>Oh, quit it! What am I supposed to say
when you thank me for punching you?</b>

16:52.040 --> 16:53.330
<b>You can't have it!</b>

16:53.630 --> 16:56.500
<b>Back off! This is MY sake!</b>

16:59.380 --> 17:02.710
<b>Hey, what are you doing?! That stuff is poison!</b>

17:02.960 --> 17:06.500
<b>Shut up! That's just an excuse for you to steal it!</b>

17:07.500 --> 17:09.380
<b>Stop! You'll cross a line you can't come back from.</b>

17:23.250 --> 17:25.330
<b>Everyone harbors some hatred inside.</b>

17:25.880 --> 17:30.290
<b>But this liquor propels that into becoming malice,
ruining people's minds...</b>

17:31.080 --> 17:33.290
<b>and turning them into demons.</b>

17:33.830 --> 17:37.960
<b>Yuki-no-Nagori is a sake made to create demons.</b>

17:38.250 --> 17:39.880
<b>I remember that boy, Kikuo...</b>

17:40.500 --> 17:43.880
<b>He must have worked here at your shop.</b>

17:44.630 --> 17:46.040
<b>But you made him drink that sake, didn't you?</b>

17:46.880 --> 17:50.500
<b>Because you wanted to know exactly
what would happen to anyone who drank it.</b>

18:22.920 --> 18:25.250
<b>Jeez. You're such a reckless fighter.</b>

18:25.540 --> 18:26.830
<b>A tsukumogami?</b>

18:27.080 --> 18:31.880
<b>It's a lucky sparrow that grants
the power of protection. Cute, ain't it?</b>

18:32.040 --> 18:33.920
<b>Thanks. I appreciate the help.</b>

18:34.080 --> 18:35.170
<b>Here he comes.</b>

18:49.500 --> 18:51.540
<b>Go, my paper swallow!</b>

19:08.250 --> 19:13.540
<b>Yeesh, this demon is oddly strong for a newborn!
Something ain't right here, ya know?</b>

19:15.920 --> 19:17.670
<b>This was all planned from the beginning...</b>

19:18.250 --> 19:20.830
<b>Or rather, it was set like a trap.</b>

19:21.170 --> 19:21.960
<b>Huh?</b>

19:22.460 --> 19:28.380
<b>Just imagine that the sake never came from a spring,
but was actually something the woman created.</b>

19:29.170 --> 19:35.330
<b>Then it stands to reason this man was put in place
to deter anyone from discovering the truth behind it.</b>

19:36.080 --> 19:40.040
<b>How is that even possible? Who is this lady?</b>

19:46.630 --> 19:50.920
<b>Dammit! How could you...?!</b>

19:53.580 --> 19:55.920
<b>Hey, what's got you so on edge?</b>

19:56.170 --> 20:00.670
<b>We're running out of time. Natsu's father
has been drinking this liquor every night.</b>

20:00.960 --> 20:02.170
<b>Wait, really?</b>

20:02.540 --> 20:04.920
<b>Cripes, that's bad news.</b>

20:05.330 --> 20:09.710
<b>Then ya best get moving, Jinya. Let me handle this freak.</b>

20:09.960 --> 20:11.420
<b>Somegoro Akitsu.</b>

20:11.750 --> 20:13.540
<b>Why so serious?</b>

20:13.790 --> 20:17.750
<b>Let me guess, you don't think
I got what it takes to beat this demon?</b>

20:19.920 --> 20:21.630
<b>Don't sell me short!</b>

20:22.000 --> 20:27.500
<b>Humans are stubborn creatures, ya know?
More so than you can even imagine.</b>

20:28.170 --> 20:30.670
<b>Got it? So you hurry along to the lil' missy.</b>

20:30.920 --> 20:31.830
<b>But...</b>

20:32.420 --> 20:38.420
<b>Listen here, the Akitsu style packs a serious punch.
I don't need your sorry butt frettin' about me.</b>

20:38.750 --> 20:39.790
<b>You have my thanks.</b>

20:43.880 --> 20:48.040
<b>That's better. I get the feeling he and I
might have to throwdown someday,</b>

20:48.290 --> 20:50.080
<b>so I gotta keep my ace up my sleeve.</b>

20:51.750 --> 20:52.960
<b>Alrighty then.</b>

20:55.710 --> 20:57.750
<b>Come on out, Demon Queller!</b>

21:04.210 --> 21:05.500
<b>Surprised?</b>

21:05.710 --> 21:09.460
<b>When Emperor Xuanzong of China
got struck by a bad illness,</b>

21:09.460 --> 21:14.210
<b>Master Zhong Kui here was the deity who wiped the floor
with the evil spirits possessing him.</b>

21:15.000 --> 21:17.670
<b>He's on a whole different level from you demons.</b>

21:18.040 --> 21:22.170
<b>But if you still wanna have
a clash of titans... then bring it on!</b>

21:44.460 --> 21:45.290
<b>Please!</b>

21:49.080 --> 21:50.420
<b>Let me make it in time!</b>

22:05.630 --> 22:08.920
<b>I'm right here. Waiting for you.</b>
